// Windows resource script — gives the .exe its icon in Explorer, the task bar
// and the Alt-Tab switcher. The first icon in the resource table is the one
// the shell uses, so this stays the only ICON entry.
//
// The window's own icon is set at runtime from the PNGs in this directory —
// see frontend/widgets/app_icon.hpp — and the .ico here is built from those.
1 ICON "icons/freebodyproblem.ico"
